<title>USA: First of Michigan names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>First of Michigan names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of Michigan Capital Corp said Monday it had named Conrad Koski as president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Koski replaces Kenneth Eich, who resigned, the company said.</p>
<p>Koski has been a senior executive of First of Michigan for 23 years, most recently as senior vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 3122-408-8787</p>
</text>
